WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:00.063 --> 00:01.963
(Production Support: MCST, Korea Creative Content Agency)

3
00:02.033 --> 00:03.463
(All characters, entities, events, and places are fictitious.)

4
00:03.533 --> 00:05.103
(Filmed In A Safe Environment With Child Actors' Guardians)

5
00:17.213 --> 00:18.643
Wait a minute

6
00:19.683 --> 00:23.953
I have something to tell you

7
00:24.023 --> 00:27.553
I feel like it has to be now

8
00:27.623 --> 00:31.423
Even if it is cheesy and embarrassing

9
00:31.493 --> 00:34.593
I have to say it

10
00:34.663 --> 00:36.133
The truth is

11
00:37.133 --> 00:40.503
Ever since I met you

12
00:41.503 --> 00:45.003
I think I have gained a little courage

13
00:45.073 --> 00:49.143
Yes, that's right. Actually, I...

14
00:50.513 --> 00:51.913
Why is Dad taking so long?

15
00:51.983 --> 00:53.083
Are you waiting for Dad?

16
00:53.153 --> 00:54.313
Or are you waiting for the fried chicken?

17
00:55.423 --> 00:58.283
I am waiting for Dad who is bringing the fried chicken.

18
01:02.923 --> 01:04.893
Oh? It is Dad.

19
01:04.963 --> 01:08.433
- Dad. - Chicken, chicken.

20
01:08.493 --> 01:09.763
Oh, that looks delicious.

21
01:09.833 --> 01:10.833
- Ta-da. - Oh, eat up.

22
01:10.903 --> 01:11.903
Eat.

23
01:14.933 --> 01:16.543
(You are fired!)

24
01:20.073 --> 01:21.543
It is truly the best.

25
01:21.613 --> 01:23.413
Do you really like it?

26
01:23.483 --> 01:24.843
I love it.

27
01:26.513 --> 01:29.453
Every single day

28
01:30.553 --> 01:31.783
It is so good, right?

29
01:35.023 --> 01:36.023
Are you crying?

30
01:39.093 --> 01:40.993
Oh, well...

31
01:41.063 --> 01:43.263
When that song first came out,

32
01:43.333 --> 01:46.233
it reminded me of when I was happy without a care in the world.

33
01:47.333 --> 01:49.303
Because I cannot go back to that time anymore.

34
01:51.173 --> 01:53.343
Or should we fly?

35
01:53.413 --> 01:57.183
Holding our two hands together

36
01:57.243 --> 02:02.053
- Let us walk slowly, step by step - At that moment,

37
02:02.113 --> 02:05.593
I do not know exactly when that time she mentioned was, but...

38
02:06.653 --> 02:10.523
I wanted to take her back there.

39
02:14.663 --> 02:19.033
Sometimes, look around you You will not be alone

40
02:19.103 --> 02:23.903
I am right here only looking at you

41
02:23.973 --> 02:26.073
I will make sure to remember

42
02:26.143 --> 02:30.443
Where your dreams grow

43
02:30.513 --> 02:34.913
- Every single day - Ian Kim!

44
02:34.983 --> 02:37.983
- Ian Kim! - Ian Kim!

45
02:51.403 --> 02:53.803
Thank you for bringing me here.

46
02:53.873 --> 02:55.543
Since you helped me with my fangirling,

47
02:55.603 --> 02:56.603
I should help you too.

48
02:57.803 --> 03:00.413
I feel good now because I feel like I have done something for you.

49
03:02.713 --> 03:05.713
If you have time, I will buy you a meal.

50
03:05.783 --> 03:07.283
What should we eat?

51
03:07.353 --> 03:09.223
What should we eat?

52
03:09.283 --> 03:10.283
Right.

53
03:10.353 --> 03:13.823
We can talk all about Volume Three and the concert while we eat.

54
03:18.863 --> 03:19.863
Let us go.

55
03:21.493 --> 03:23.303
Are you two on a date by any chance?

56
03:25.233 --> 03:27.133
Chef.

57
03:27.203 --> 03:29.103
Oh, it is not like that.

58
03:29.173 --> 03:33.043
Oh, then is holding hands not a bit much?

59
03:33.113 --> 03:35.413
- Who is this? - Oh, this is...

60
03:39.183 --> 03:41.183
Maybe because you are Tak Mu I,

61
03:41.253 --> 03:42.753
there are a lot of eyes on us.

62
03:45.053 --> 03:46.053
Oh my...

63
03:49.393 --> 03:51.593
Since we are holding hands, it is nice to meet you.

64
03:51.663 --> 03:54.533
I am Kang Hee Su, owner-chef of the restaurant Yu Il will work at.

65
03:56.763 --> 03:58.633
I see.

66
03:58.703 --> 04:01.403
Since you seem to already know me, I will skip the introduction.

67
04:07.173 --> 04:10.213
Oh, Yu Il, I was actually going to call you.

68
04:10.283 --> 04:11.613
But we end up meeting here like this.

69
04:11.683 --> 04:14.983
I know. Do you like Ian Kim too, Chef?

70
04:15.053 --> 04:18.023
No, Ryu Min asked me to come.

71
04:18.083 --> 04:21.553
Oh, you know Ryu Min.

72
04:21.623 --> 04:24.323
Ryu Min should be in the waiting room over there,

73
04:24.393 --> 04:26.733
so go ahead and say hello.

74
04:26.793 --> 04:28.393
We are hungry, so we will be going now.

75
04:30.033 --> 04:32.733
Then I will see you at work.

76
04:32.803 --> 04:35.703
By the way, have you decided where to go?

77
04:37.173 --> 04:38.543
Since it is late right now,

78
04:38.603 --> 04:42.273
most of the restaurants around here are probably closed.

79
04:42.343 --> 04:44.013
Instead of doing that,

80
04:44.083 --> 04:45.243
how about The Kitchen?

81
04:46.383 --> 04:47.913
Your restaurant, Chef?

82
04:47.983 --> 04:50.383
I was planning to take Ryu Min there to feed him anyway.

83
04:52.023 --> 04:53.023
Well.

84
04:57.723 --> 04:59.533
Tak Mu I.

85
04:59.593 --> 05:01.833
If you wear that mask and hat,

86
05:01.893 --> 05:03.403
do you think people will not recognize you?

87
05:04.533 --> 05:07.673
You grabbed her hand without thinking...

88
05:07.733 --> 05:10.773
and did not consider the trouble...

89
05:10.843 --> 05:12.073
you might cause her.

90
05:19.713 --> 05:23.083
Alright, well, let us go. The Chicken.

91
05:24.523 --> 05:25.583
The Kitchen.

92
05:27.223 --> 05:28.223
Same difference.

93
05:29.863 --> 05:31.323
By the way, when did you get a job?

94
05:31.393 --> 05:34.493
It is not a full-time job, just part-time.

95
05:37.003 --> 05:38.003
Let us go.

96
05:48.943 --> 05:50.813
It is delicious, right?

97
05:50.883 --> 05:51.883
Yes, I suppose.

98
05:59.123 --> 06:00.153
Here is your food.

99
06:02.523 --> 06:06.663
This white asparagus was cooked slowly at a low temperature...

100
06:06.733 --> 06:09.863
and then paired with lemon zest and cream mousse.

101
06:09.933 --> 06:13.903
The subtle acidity and soft texture are the key points.

102
06:13.973 --> 06:14.973
Wow.

103
06:16.073 --> 06:18.503
What is this sprinkled on top?

104
06:18.573 --> 06:20.873
Pine nuts. Ground pine nuts.

105
06:22.583 --> 06:25.483
A crumble made from roasted pine nuts, truffle oil,

106
06:25.543 --> 06:27.513
and tomato jelly on the side.

107
06:27.583 --> 06:30.753
- For the texture... - So this is the tomato jelly.

108
06:34.123 --> 06:38.393
I minimized the gelatin for the sake of texture and flavor.

109
06:38.463 --> 06:41.693
- Try it. - It is so pretty. How can I eat it?

110
06:48.103 --> 06:50.603
Gosh, leaving me out. You traitors.

111
06:51.803 --> 06:53.243
Who invited her?

112
06:53.313 --> 06:55.213
Did you think I would not find out if you did not invite me?

113
06:55.273 --> 06:56.483
Mu I, you...

114
06:56.543 --> 06:58.943
How could you leave me out of that concert?

115
06:59.013 --> 07:00.913
- Gosh. - Oh, well...

116
07:00.983 --> 07:04.453
He got the tickets because I said I liked Ian Kim.

117
07:04.523 --> 07:06.823
Da Hong, if I had known you liked him...

118
07:06.893 --> 07:11.623
I am just joking, Yu Il. The only guy I like is Mu I.

119
07:13.693 --> 07:15.903
Hello, Chef. I am Ju Da Hong.

120
07:15.963 --> 07:17.563
I know. It is nice to meet you.

121
07:17.633 --> 07:19.233
I have heard a lot about you from Min.

122
07:19.303 --> 07:23.203
What kind of things did he say?

123
07:23.273 --> 07:24.403
That you are incredibly loud.

124
07:26.243 --> 07:28.343
It is a relief that you knew in advance.

125
07:28.413 --> 07:30.143
No, but...

126
07:30.213 --> 07:32.383
Is it okay for you to be with Min?

127
07:33.413 --> 07:35.853
Right now, it is probably worse for me to be with Mu I.

128
07:36.983 --> 07:39.193
Chef, do you have dark beer here?

129
07:50.133 --> 07:52.503
Still, it would have been better if you had held back a little.

130
07:52.573 --> 07:54.833
Hey, that is easy for you to say.

131
07:54.903 --> 07:57.073
How can I hold back when I am so furious?

132
07:57.143 --> 07:59.543
They embarrassed me in front of all the staff. Gosh.

133
07:59.613 --> 08:01.243
- Right? Am I right? What? - Next to me is Ju Da Hong.

134
08:01.313 --> 08:03.313
- Right, right. - And in front of me is Ryu Min.

135
08:03.383 --> 08:04.613
You are right.

136
08:04.683 --> 08:07.153
And even that guy.

137
08:09.083 --> 08:11.583
This is just way too unrealistic.

138
08:16.623 --> 08:19.093
Seriously. That is a little strange.

139
08:20.463 --> 08:21.463
But what is that?

140
08:34.343 --> 08:38.183
My heart still aches because of how you left last time.

141
08:38.243 --> 08:41.953
Could you just give your dad one more chance, for my sake?

142
08:42.013 --> 08:44.883
(Could you give your dad one more chance, for my sake?)

143
08:46.693 --> 08:47.753
Oh, Chef.

144
08:52.533 --> 08:54.633
How was the food?

145
08:54.693 --> 08:56.963
Every single dish was really delicious.

146
08:57.033 --> 08:58.663
All of them.

147
08:58.733 --> 09:02.173
I can see why this is a favorite spot for celebrities.

148
09:02.233 --> 09:04.873
Later on, you might find it hard to quit...

149
09:04.943 --> 09:06.343
just because of our staff meals.

150
09:06.413 --> 09:08.213
Oh? You provide meals here too?

151
09:10.313 --> 09:12.613
Of course, did you think we would make you work while starving?

152
09:14.083 --> 09:16.653
Wow, just thinking about it makes me excited.

153
09:19.423 --> 09:21.823
What? But what happened here?

154
09:23.023 --> 09:26.533
Oh, I must have scratched it while taking something out earlier.

155
09:26.593 --> 09:28.633
Oh, wait a second.

156
09:36.103 --> 09:37.743
But this is my right hand...

157
09:37.803 --> 09:38.803
Oh, right.

158
09:50.123 --> 09:51.623
The pattern is a bit much, right?

159
09:53.553 --> 09:55.823
It is cute, Pharmacist.

160
09:55.893 --> 09:56.893
Pharmacist?

161
09:59.993 --> 10:00.993
I like it.

162
10:04.103 --> 10:06.833
Hey, I just found out.

163
10:06.903 --> 10:07.973
You have never dated anyone?

164
10:11.843 --> 10:12.843
No comment.

165
10:16.613 --> 10:18.913
Popular singer Ryu Min, known for having never dated,

166
10:18.983 --> 10:22.853
was recently rumored to be dating pretty, sexy actress Ju Da Hong.

167
10:22.923 --> 10:24.583
How do you feel about that?

168
10:24.653 --> 10:26.953
Were you annoyed, or did your heart flutter?

169
10:28.323 --> 10:29.523
You better choose your words carefully.

170
10:34.563 --> 10:35.663
I was worried about you.

171
10:38.903 --> 10:41.703
I also felt sorry because it seemed like it happened due to my mistake.

172
10:43.373 --> 10:45.303
I can tolerate people misunderstanding and criticizing me.

173
10:47.813 --> 10:50.683
But it is hard seeing my friends and family get in trouble because of me.

174
10:53.483 --> 10:54.683
And there is no way for me to help.

175
10:56.483 --> 10:57.483
Are you okay?

176
10:58.483 --> 10:59.493
How was it for you?

177
11:00.823 --> 11:02.653
What do you mean?

178
11:02.723 --> 11:04.823
I was full from all the hate I got.

179
11:12.603 --> 11:14.933
Oh, those two were together.

180
11:15.003 --> 11:16.973
Yu Il, hurry up and come here.

181
11:17.043 --> 11:18.703
Chef, you should stop cooking and come sit down too.

182
11:18.773 --> 11:20.213
We are all full.

183
11:20.273 --> 11:22.013
- Have a seat. - Yes, thank you.

184
11:31.823 --> 11:34.093
Come to think of it, it is a little strange.

185
11:34.153 --> 11:36.023
There would be a lot of people at a concert,

186
11:36.093 --> 11:38.793
so if Yu Il wanted to see it, you could have just gotten her a ticket.

187
11:40.033 --> 11:41.933
Why did you go together?

188
11:41.993 --> 11:43.103
What do you mean, why?

189
11:44.303 --> 11:46.133
I wanted to see it too, so we went together.

190
11:46.203 --> 11:48.603
Well, it is still a little strange.

191
11:48.673 --> 11:51.073
You went to a concert alone with a non-celebrity?

192
11:53.013 --> 11:54.243
Oh, what are you so curious about?

193
11:55.373 --> 11:57.583
Yu Il, by any chance...

194
11:57.643 --> 11:59.413
What do you think of Mu I?

195
11:59.483 --> 12:00.483
As a boyfriend.

196
12:02.313 --> 12:03.653
What?

197
12:03.653 --> 12:05.383
That's absurd.

198
12:05.453 --> 12:07.653
Oh, why would you ask that?

199
12:07.723 --> 12:09.993
Have you never thought about it?

200
12:12.663 --> 12:13.893
Come on.

201
12:13.963 --> 12:15.363
That is nonsense.

202
12:20.903 --> 12:23.873
Oh, even thinking about it again, it is absolute nonsense.

203
12:26.443 --> 12:28.713
Oh, why do I feel like I just got rejected for no reason?

204
12:33.953 --> 12:36.013
You are...

205
12:36.083 --> 12:39.083
a truly amazing, wonderful person, but...

206
12:42.023 --> 12:44.393
you are not my type.

207
12:50.203 --> 12:52.033
Let us hear it, then.

208
12:52.103 --> 12:53.973
What kind of person is your type?

209
12:54.033 --> 12:55.433
Well...

210
12:56.873 --> 12:59.043
An ordinary person?

211
12:59.103 --> 13:00.113
Specifically?

212
13:01.413 --> 13:05.883
Getting off work in the evening and eating dinner together,

213
13:05.943 --> 13:09.553
watching a movie and going to the park together on the weekend,

214
13:09.623 --> 13:11.853
and then saving up money for our anniversary...

215
13:11.923 --> 13:14.323
to come to a restaurant like this, things like that?

216
13:21.263 --> 13:24.003
We are far from ordinary.

217
13:24.063 --> 13:25.663
Very far, yes.

218
13:29.373 --> 13:31.443
Please drive safely. Yes.

219
13:32.803 --> 13:35.613
Oh, Yu Il, get in my car. I will take you home.

220
13:35.673 --> 13:37.113
Not me?

221
13:37.183 --> 13:40.113
- She's my guest. - Oh, then what about me?

222
13:40.183 --> 13:42.183
Her house and our house are in completely opposite directions.

223
13:42.253 --> 13:45.023
Oh, I sneaked out, so I have to get back quickly.

224
13:45.083 --> 13:46.823
Should I call you a taxi?

225
13:46.893 --> 13:50.363
Gosh, I am going to do a live stream again.

226
13:50.423 --> 13:53.163
I am fine. I will take the bus.

227
13:53.233 --> 13:54.733
Oh, but still...

228
13:54.793 --> 13:56.863
I will take Yu Il home.

229
13:56.933 --> 14:00.603
- Since she is my employee. - Oh, that works.

230
14:00.673 --> 14:01.733
You two look good together.

231
14:02.943 --> 14:04.603
I will get going.

232
14:04.673 --> 14:07.013
- Get home safely. - Okay.

233
14:07.073 --> 14:08.073
Bye.

234
14:15.983 --> 14:19.953
I noticed earlier that Da Hong had a lot of questions for you.

235
14:21.323 --> 14:22.323
Tell me about it.

236
14:23.993 --> 14:26.023
Can I ask you something I am curious about, too?

237
14:28.233 --> 14:31.433
How did you get close to Tak Mu I?

238
14:32.533 --> 14:34.073
Oh that.

239
14:34.133 --> 14:36.073
My friend is the producer...

240
14:36.133 --> 14:39.143
for the drama that Da Hong and Tak Mu I are in.

241
14:39.203 --> 14:43.483
She said they needed a rooftop. And I needed money.

242
14:43.543 --> 14:45.683
So I rented it out to them.

243
14:45.743 --> 14:48.453
Oh, I live in a rooftop apartment.

244
14:48.513 --> 14:50.223
I see.

245
14:50.283 --> 14:54.093
Filming in front of your place does not mean you become friends.

246
14:55.323 --> 14:57.293
There was a bit of a misunderstanding,

247
14:57.363 --> 15:00.463
and one thing led to another while we were clearing it up.

248
15:02.763 --> 15:06.273
What kind of person is Tak Mu I?

249
15:06.333 --> 15:08.033
Well.

250
15:08.103 --> 15:10.673
He was not that great at first,

251
15:10.743 --> 15:13.073
but it turns out he is a really good person.

252
15:14.143 --> 15:18.043
I am not entirely sure, but his MBTI is probably an F.

253
15:18.113 --> 15:22.053
He is highly empathetic and very sensitive.

254
15:23.953 --> 15:25.623
What about me?

255
15:25.683 --> 15:27.593
What kind of person do you think I am?

256
15:27.653 --> 15:29.123
Oh, I am not sure.

257
15:29.193 --> 15:30.823
We have not known each other for very long.

258
15:32.223 --> 15:33.833
Well, we can slowly get to know each other.

259
15:35.833 --> 15:38.233
Oh. We are here.

260
15:39.673 --> 15:41.973
Oh, how did you know this was my house?

261
15:43.543 --> 15:44.573
(Taewon-ro 17-gil)

262
15:44.703 --> 15:45.943
I saw it on your resume.

263
15:47.113 --> 15:48.113
Oh, right.

264
15:51.713 --> 15:52.983
- Excuse me, sir. - Yes.

265
15:53.053 --> 15:55.153
Please go to the back of the house instead of the front.

266
15:55.213 --> 15:56.783
Yes, understood.

267
15:56.853 --> 15:59.353
- Are you going to jump the wall? - Yes.

268
15:59.423 --> 16:01.653
That is what you get for causing trouble.

269
16:01.723 --> 16:03.493
That was hardly even trouble.

270
16:05.363 --> 16:07.193
- Da Hong. - Yes?

271
16:07.263 --> 16:08.563
That chef.

272
16:08.633 --> 16:09.803
What kind of person do you think he is?

273
16:11.463 --> 16:12.763
I do not really know, but...

274
16:12.833 --> 16:15.503
Min said he comes from a super rich family.

275
16:15.573 --> 16:16.973
How rich?

276
16:17.043 --> 16:18.643
They are incredibly wealthy,

277
16:18.703 --> 16:21.013
and his family members are all doctors and professors,

278
16:21.073 --> 16:22.643
but he studied abroad alone and fell in love with cooking.

279
16:22.713 --> 16:25.313
He became a chef against his family's wishes.

280
16:25.383 --> 16:26.753
I see.

281
16:26.813 --> 16:28.483
But do you know what's really amazing?

282
16:28.553 --> 16:31.553
He started from the bottom without any help from his family.

283
16:31.623 --> 16:33.793
He opened his own restaurant and even got a Michelin star.

284
16:35.223 --> 16:36.293
That is quite impressive.

285
17:03.753 --> 17:04.753
Did she get home safely?

286
17:15.963 --> 17:17.863
Right, I do not have her number.

287
17:20.403 --> 17:21.633
Should I ask Producer Yeon Ju?

288
17:24.543 --> 17:25.603
It seems too late for that.

289
17:28.343 --> 17:29.983
As for Da Hong...

290
17:31.283 --> 17:32.943
She will definitely ask too many questions.

291
17:57.773 --> 17:59.603
Did she already quit?

292
18:06.653 --> 18:10.523
Chef, did you really do all of this by yourself?

293
18:10.583 --> 18:12.253
I did them one by one.

294
18:12.323 --> 18:14.153
Hey, what is going on?

295
18:14.223 --> 18:16.823
You never cook outside of business hours.

296
18:16.893 --> 18:20.093
I was just preparing the menu for the new employee to study.

297
18:20.163 --> 18:21.563
You have never done that before.

298
18:23.403 --> 18:24.533
Just let it go.

299
18:25.663 --> 18:29.733
You are acting strange, Chef. Especially with the new hire.

300
18:29.803 --> 18:32.273
Is she pretty? Or is she sexy?

301
18:32.343 --> 18:34.113
Give me a break.

302
18:34.173 --> 18:36.243
- Clean this up quickly. - Yes, Chef.

303
18:40.413 --> 18:42.483
I am so hungry.

304
18:42.553 --> 18:45.883
It would be strange if you were not. You have been starving all day.

305
18:45.953 --> 18:48.053
Strangely, I was not hungry during the shoot,

306
18:48.123 --> 18:50.023
but now that it is over, I am starving.

307
18:50.093 --> 18:52.193
Do you want to eat together?

308
18:52.263 --> 18:54.793
What should we do? I have to take my mother to the hospital today.

309
18:54.863 --> 18:56.663
Oh, right.

310
18:56.733 --> 18:58.733
Do you want to buy something to take home?

311
18:58.803 --> 19:00.503
No.

312
19:00.573 --> 19:02.833
I just do not want to eat alone today.

313
19:05.103 --> 19:08.213
I really hate the idea of eating alone today.

314
19:08.273 --> 19:12.583
- I really, really do not want to. - Stop it.

315
19:18.083 --> 19:19.123
- Hey. - What?

316
19:19.183 --> 19:20.493
Please pull over right up ahead.

317
19:20.553 --> 19:23.293
- Here? - Yes, right over there.

318
19:23.363 --> 19:24.363
Where are you going?

319
19:24.423 --> 19:29.063
(Hometown Diner)

320
19:30.063 --> 19:31.833
Hello, ma'am.

321
19:31.903 --> 19:33.403
You are not closing right now, are you?

322
19:33.473 --> 19:35.233
Oh, it is the handsome young man.

323
19:35.303 --> 19:37.573
I was just about to close. What is the matter?

324
19:37.643 --> 19:41.443
Oh, no. I have not had a single meal today.

325
19:41.513 --> 19:44.943
No matter how handsome you are, I cannot sell you food today.

326
19:45.013 --> 19:46.783
The rice cooker is broken.

327
19:46.853 --> 19:50.383
- What? - What great work are you doing...

328
19:50.453 --> 19:53.053
that a young person like you is starving all day?

329
19:54.053 --> 19:56.293
Anyway, come back next time.

330
19:56.353 --> 20:00.163
I will give you a generous portion to make up for today.

331
20:00.233 --> 20:01.233
Okay.

332
20:02.233 --> 20:03.833
(Home-Style Meal, Braised Cutlassfish)

333
20:04.163 --> 20:06.033
- Let me help you with that. - Thank you.

334
20:11.103 --> 20:13.243
- Here you go. - What is this?

335
20:13.313 --> 20:17.243
- Did the pretty girl come with you? - Oh? It is Gong Yu Il.

336
20:17.313 --> 20:18.843
Wow, what a coincidence.

337
20:18.913 --> 20:21.283
Oh my, what is going on?

338
20:21.353 --> 20:22.713
You are not the only one who starved.

339
20:22.783 --> 20:24.583
Did you make this pretty girl starve all day too?

340
20:25.723 --> 20:28.593
No, it is not like that. We came separately.

341
20:28.653 --> 20:31.063
Hurry up and take her to get some food.

342
20:31.123 --> 20:34.533
How can you starve a student who is already this skinny?

343
20:34.593 --> 20:36.963
I've told you so many times that I am not a student...

344
20:37.033 --> 20:39.203
I know, I will not call you a student anymore.

345
20:39.263 --> 20:40.903
Go on, now.

346
20:40.973 --> 20:42.273
- Yes, goodbye. - Take care.

347
20:42.333 --> 20:43.343
Seriously.

348
20:45.203 --> 20:46.543
Did you get home safely yesterday?

349
20:46.613 --> 20:49.943
Yes, Chef dropped me off right in front of my house.

350
20:51.243 --> 20:52.513
Did you quit the convenience store?

351
20:54.113 --> 20:55.553
Yes, it ended up that way.

352
20:57.723 --> 20:58.953
When do you start working at The Kitchen?

353
21:00.123 --> 21:01.123
Starting next week.

354
21:02.153 --> 21:03.153
I see.

355
21:04.563 --> 21:06.423
Since all my questions are answered,

356
21:06.493 --> 21:08.393
let's go eat.

357
21:08.463 --> 21:11.363
- What? - She said to take you and feed you.

358
21:11.433 --> 21:12.833
Let's go, student.

359
21:12.903 --> 21:15.573
Where are we going?

360
21:15.633 --> 21:18.103
Did you not say you would buy me a meal after the concert?

361
21:18.173 --> 21:20.413
You are not calling it even with the meal at The Kitchen?

362
21:21.513 --> 21:23.173
Buy me that meal today.

363
21:26.783 --> 21:28.953
This is a Caprese salad garnished with pansies.

364
21:29.013 --> 21:32.423
Cut the burrata cheese and enjoy it with the tomatoes.

365
21:32.483 --> 21:33.523
Enjoy your meal.

366
21:34.523 --> 21:35.523
Thank you.

367
21:47.033 --> 21:49.933
- We will have Course A. - Yes, I will prepare that for you.

368
21:55.973 --> 21:58.813
At 130 dollars each, that is 260 dollars.

369
21:58.883 --> 22:01.313
With the minimum wage at eight dollars,

370
22:01.383 --> 22:04.183
that is about 32.9 hours.

371
22:04.253 --> 22:05.453
(Approximately 32.9 Hours)

372
22:05.523 --> 22:07.453
(Gong Yu Il's Bank Account: 680 Dollars)

373
22:14.433 --> 22:15.733
Are you not going to eat?

374
22:15.793 --> 22:18.963
Excuse me? Oh, no, I am eating.

375
22:22.373 --> 22:23.503
Are you uncomfortable?

376
22:25.603 --> 22:26.603
Oh, no.

377
22:28.273 --> 22:32.443
But what if people misunderstand?

378
22:34.253 --> 22:35.753
Do not worry.

379
22:35.813 --> 22:38.883
To others, we will just look like people on a date.

380
22:38.953 --> 22:41.053
Exactly.

381
22:41.123 --> 22:43.763
That is why I am worried about it.

382
22:45.223 --> 22:46.223
Here, look.

383
22:47.333 --> 22:50.363
Everyone is too busy taking photos and eating expensive food...

384
22:50.433 --> 22:52.663
to care about the back of my head.

385
22:52.733 --> 22:56.673
So since we are here, let's just enjoy the meal.

386
22:56.743 --> 22:58.843
I want to enjoy it,

387
22:58.903 --> 23:01.513
but it is too pretty to just dig in.

388
23:06.543 --> 23:09.053
Today's final course is...

389
23:09.113 --> 23:11.383
a lemon mango mousse sprinkled with cornflowers. Enjoy your meal.

390
23:11.453 --> 23:12.453
Thank you for the food.

391
23:16.963 --> 23:19.363
It is another pretty flower garden.

392
23:28.033 --> 23:29.073
This is so delicious.

393
23:30.603 --> 23:32.643
My taste buds are being spoiled day after day.

394
23:34.543 --> 23:35.543
How cute.

395
23:39.543 --> 23:40.553
Excuse me?

396
23:42.013 --> 23:43.453
I mean...

397
23:43.523 --> 23:46.283
The way you eat looks just like Yeong Su.

398
23:47.823 --> 23:50.423
He is really cute when he eats.

399
23:52.063 --> 23:53.063
I see.

400
24:06.873 --> 24:09.143
When did you pay the bill?

401
24:09.213 --> 24:10.743
Earlier, when you went to the restroom, Yu Il.

402
24:11.943 --> 24:13.413
Why did you do that?

403
24:13.483 --> 24:16.153
I am just thankful that you ate with me.

404
24:16.213 --> 24:18.823
I really did not want to eat alone today.

405
24:19.853 --> 24:22.793
But I was supposed to buy it.

406
24:22.853 --> 24:24.523
You can buy it next time.

407
24:24.593 --> 24:25.593
That way, we can see each other again.

408
24:28.163 --> 24:29.363
Shall we walk for a bit?

409
24:34.503 --> 24:35.873
What is the relationship between those two?

410
24:35.933 --> 24:38.843
- Tak Mu I looks much more handsome. - I know, right?

411
24:38.903 --> 24:41.913
- Ju Da Hong will be upset to know. - Oh, I know. What is going on?

412
24:41.973 --> 24:43.313
Oh, what is this? Tak Mu I.

413
24:44.583 --> 24:47.353
- Wow, Tak Mu I is really handsome. - I took a picture secretly.

414
24:48.713 --> 24:52.323
No matter how much I think about it, I should've paid.

415
24:52.383 --> 24:54.953
You lent me the book for free.

416
24:54.953 --> 24:56.723
You could've sold it for a high price.

417
24:56.793 --> 24:59.423
Hey, that's why you took me to the concert.

418
24:59.493 --> 25:01.693
Hey, that doesn't even compare.

419
25:02.793 --> 25:05.763
When I get a job, let's go again.

420
25:05.833 --> 25:08.603
I don't know if we'll be able to see each other until then, though.

421
25:10.133 --> 25:12.043
That makes me sad.

422
25:14.313 --> 25:17.513
- Oh, no, that's not what I meant... - Oh, right, your number.

423
25:19.483 --> 25:21.983
I realized I still do not have your number.

424
25:22.053 --> 25:23.653
Oh, that's true.

425
25:23.723 --> 25:26.523
You even picked me up from my house for the concert.

426
25:26.583 --> 25:27.593
Type it in.

427
25:47.273 --> 25:48.943
By the way.

428
25:49.013 --> 25:52.183
As time passed after I read Volume Three,

429
25:52.243 --> 25:55.453
I stopped worrying about Moon Bear alone in the forest.

430
25:55.513 --> 25:57.083
I was more worried about Byeol I.

431
25:58.783 --> 26:00.593
Why?

432
26:00.653 --> 26:02.323
The day Moon Bear left,

433
26:02.393 --> 26:04.823
Byeol I's dad said he was leaving home too, right?

434
26:06.423 --> 26:07.563
Oh, did he?

435
26:09.133 --> 26:10.603
Do you think he really left?

436
26:17.643 --> 26:20.643
- Well... - This is really good. Try some.

437
26:21.813 --> 26:23.983
Want some ramyeon before you go?

438
26:24.043 --> 26:25.043
What?

439
26:37.293 --> 26:40.223
I am crazy. What was I thinking?

440
26:40.293 --> 26:43.663
What about the messy house and the awkward atmosphere?

441
26:49.203 --> 26:52.173
Oh, we don't have to eat if you don't want to.

442
26:53.473 --> 26:55.013
Then...

443
26:55.073 --> 26:56.543
Wait here for five minutes.

444
27:11.793 --> 27:14.493
It feels different coming here like this.

445
27:16.063 --> 27:17.803
Please come in.

446
27:36.583 --> 27:38.453
Oh, I'm doomed.

447
27:38.523 --> 27:40.793
I think I'll have to run for at least three hours.

448
27:40.853 --> 27:44.623
Wow, how do you make ramyeon so well? I almost added rice.

449
27:44.693 --> 27:47.763
How long has it been since you had ramyeon?

450
27:48.933 --> 27:50.503
Well...

451
27:50.563 --> 27:52.363
I don't even remember.

452
27:52.433 --> 27:54.033
When I was young,

453
27:54.103 --> 27:56.203
I got caught eating it secretly and got scolded by my grandmother.

454
27:57.273 --> 28:00.773
Oh, I don't know if you know...

455
28:00.843 --> 28:03.373
My parents passed away, and I was raised by my grandmother.

456
28:04.443 --> 28:07.313
You know my grandmother is an actress, right?

457
28:07.383 --> 28:10.253
Oh, of course. How could I not know?

458
28:10.313 --> 28:11.723
She's very famous.

459
28:13.023 --> 28:14.893
But what about you, Tak Mu I?

460
28:14.953 --> 28:17.993
How did you start acting?

461
28:18.063 --> 28:19.193
Following your grandmother?

462
28:20.693 --> 28:21.693
Following her?

463
28:22.993 --> 28:24.703
Well, I guess that's right.

464
28:25.933 --> 28:27.533
After my parents passed away,

465
28:27.603 --> 28:29.303
I followed my grandmother to the set,

466
28:29.373 --> 28:33.043
and because a child actor bailed, I was cast on the spot.

467
28:33.103 --> 28:35.873
Oh, really?

468
28:35.943 --> 28:37.683
Even though it was fake,

469
28:37.743 --> 28:39.283
I had a mom,

470
28:39.343 --> 28:41.183
a dad,

471
28:41.253 --> 28:42.353
and an older brother and a younger brother.

472
28:44.153 --> 28:47.193
I guess I liked that bustling atmosphere...

473
28:47.253 --> 28:49.023
because I kept thinking about it for days.

474
28:50.593 --> 28:53.063
So I begged her to let me act.

475
28:54.133 --> 28:57.463
- Did your grandmother allow it? - Yes. Surprising, right?

476
29:01.133 --> 29:02.573
She said even if it was just acting,

477
29:02.633 --> 29:04.273
I could call out for mom and dad as much as I wanted.

478
29:14.553 --> 29:15.553
Are you crying?

479
29:16.583 --> 29:18.883
No, who's crying?

480
29:22.493 --> 29:25.623
- I should do the dishes. - No, I'll do it.

481
29:25.693 --> 29:27.093
Why would a guest...

482
29:27.163 --> 29:28.633
You should get going now.

483
29:28.693 --> 29:30.963
Then let us make a bet. A dishwashing bet.

484
29:32.733 --> 29:33.733
A bet?

485
29:37.703 --> 29:38.973
I cannot resist a bet.

486
29:41.843 --> 29:43.113
How about a word chain game?

487
29:44.443 --> 29:46.413
- Music. - What?

488
29:46.483 --> 29:48.913
You said you'd play word chain. Music.

489
29:48.983 --> 29:49.983
C?

490
29:52.383 --> 29:53.623
Curium.

491
29:55.353 --> 29:57.053
Curium...

492
29:57.123 --> 29:59.023
M...

493
29:59.093 --> 30:01.933
- Five, four, three... - M...

494
30:01.993 --> 30:03.493
- Wait a minute. - Two, one.

495
30:03.563 --> 30:05.533
- M... - Ding.

496
30:05.603 --> 30:07.133
M...

497
30:07.203 --> 30:08.833
Let us play one more time.

498
30:08.903 --> 30:11.403
I will go first. Monster.

499
30:13.143 --> 30:15.343
- Radix. - X?

500
30:15.413 --> 30:16.513
Quartz.

501
30:17.643 --> 30:18.743
Topaz.

502
30:22.483 --> 30:25.523
Why is she not answering her phone?

503
30:25.583 --> 30:27.453
It has been a while since she said she was done.

504
30:28.823 --> 30:31.923
- Did she fall asleep? - The number is not available...

505
30:38.803 --> 30:41.873
You actually wanted to make me wash the dishes, did you not?

506
30:41.933 --> 30:43.773
That is not it.

507
30:43.833 --> 30:46.703
I just really like bets,

508
30:46.773 --> 30:48.643
and my vocabulary is quite exceptional.

509
30:55.513 --> 30:56.613
What are you looking at so intently?

510
30:58.353 --> 30:59.723
Well,

511
30:59.783 --> 31:02.053
this room does not appear in the drama,

512
31:02.123 --> 31:04.763
but it is where the female lead lives in the story.

513
31:04.823 --> 31:05.863
But when I see you...

514
31:05.923 --> 31:08.463
washing dishes here in front of me,

515
31:08.533 --> 31:11.303
I feel like I have entered the drama.

516
31:11.363 --> 31:13.463
It is a fascinating feeling.

517
31:15.273 --> 31:16.433
You find the most random things fascinating.

518
31:18.043 --> 31:20.813
By the way, are you really a fan of Ryu Min?

519
31:22.643 --> 31:24.383
What? Why do you ask?

520
31:24.443 --> 31:26.343
Usually, fans...

521
31:26.413 --> 31:27.883
cannot bring themselves to use merchandise like this.

522
31:31.483 --> 31:36.423
Well, I did not have any clean cups, so I just used it for a moment.

523
31:38.063 --> 31:39.693
There are so many cups right here.

524
31:43.563 --> 31:45.033
Actually,

525
31:45.103 --> 31:47.703
my friend is the fan, not me.

526
31:47.773 --> 31:49.503
She said if I display them like this,

527
31:49.573 --> 31:52.303
Ryu Min would like it when he comes and goes.

528
31:52.803 --> 31:53.873
Seriously?

529
31:53.873 --> 31:55.573
Then why...

530
31:55.643 --> 31:58.813
Because you were pushing so hard to label me as a stalker back then.

531
32:04.383 --> 32:07.423
Gong. Hey, Gong Yu Il, open the door.

532
32:09.553 --> 32:10.553
What should we do?

533
32:11.663 --> 32:13.493
- What does it matter? - Hey, Gong.

534
32:13.563 --> 32:16.293
If the book comes up, it will be weird, so hide quickly.

535
32:16.363 --> 32:17.363
No.

536
32:19.063 --> 32:21.803
- Gong. Are you washing up? - Hurry. In the closet over there.

537
32:21.873 --> 32:25.303
Seriously. I...

538
32:25.373 --> 32:26.373
Darn it.

539
32:28.643 --> 32:30.373
I am coming out.

540
32:36.983 --> 32:37.983
What is this?

541
32:39.553 --> 32:41.993
It does not look like you were washing up.

542
32:42.053 --> 32:45.623
- I was in the bathroom. - Did you do number two?

543
32:45.693 --> 32:47.793
I called you for a long time and you did not answer.

544
32:47.863 --> 32:50.803
It was on vibrate, so I guess I did not hear it.

545
32:52.133 --> 32:53.163
Did you eat ramyeon?

546
32:54.733 --> 32:55.803
Yes.

547
32:57.503 --> 33:00.573
But this is strange. There are two bowls,

548
33:00.643 --> 33:03.843
two pairs of chopsticks, and two spoons.

549
33:03.913 --> 33:05.113
Well...

550
33:05.183 --> 33:07.853
I was going to wash the ones from breakfast all at once.

551
33:08.953 --> 33:10.413
But...

552
33:10.483 --> 33:13.523
There is no way you ate two bowls...

553
33:13.583 --> 33:14.853
and had ramyeon for two meals?

554
33:16.253 --> 33:17.723
- What? - Yes.

555
33:19.293 --> 33:22.393
Hey, where are you going? Why?

556
33:22.463 --> 33:24.933
You were with Yong Seok, were you not?

557
33:25.003 --> 33:26.303
No, I was not.

558
33:26.363 --> 33:28.133
What do you mean, no?

559
33:28.203 --> 33:30.743
I am going to kill him today. Hey, come out.

560
33:30.803 --> 33:33.743
- What is wrong with you? - Let go of me.

561
33:34.743 --> 33:36.573
Seriously.

562
33:36.643 --> 33:39.313
Found him. Move.

563
33:39.383 --> 33:42.353
- Why? - Get out of the way.

564
33:42.413 --> 33:45.823
- This is just a closet. - No, it is not.

565
33:45.883 --> 33:46.883
No...

566
33:48.553 --> 33:49.623
Don't.

567
33:52.363 --> 33:55.833
Hey, Kim Yong Seok. Come out here.

568
33:55.893 --> 33:57.733
Yeon Ju, it is not what you think.

569
34:00.203 --> 34:01.933
Cramp!

570
34:04.643 --> 34:06.403
- Cramp. - Tak Mu I?

571
34:25.923 --> 34:30.903
So I lent him that book, and he was thankful for it.

572
34:30.963 --> 34:34.803
If he is thankful, why are you cooking for him?

573
34:34.873 --> 34:38.103
He got me tickets to Ian Kim's concert because of the book,

574
34:38.173 --> 34:39.943
but I couldn't buy him a meal that day.

575
34:41.373 --> 34:43.243
I don't know, it is complicated to explain.

576
34:44.283 --> 34:46.343
You two went to a concert together?

577
34:46.413 --> 34:49.153
I am just saying this out of concern.

578
34:49.213 --> 34:50.583
You know celebrities...

579
34:50.653 --> 34:52.883
are a different species from us, right?

580
34:54.253 --> 34:55.253
What do you mean, different?

581
34:55.323 --> 34:58.563
- We are all just people. - Look at you. You remember, right?

582
34:58.623 --> 35:00.623
When I dated that rookie actor.

583
35:00.693 --> 35:03.563
How could I forget? You made such a huge fuss about it.

584
35:03.633 --> 35:07.003
We couldn't go anywhere. We couldn't do anything.

585
35:07.063 --> 35:09.673
It feels even worse than not being able...

586
35:09.733 --> 35:11.603
to call your own father "Father."

587
35:11.603 --> 35:13.073
Restaurant tours,

588
35:13.143 --> 35:15.313
holding hands while walking, shopping,

589
35:15.373 --> 35:18.213
just all those normal things everyone else does.

590
35:18.283 --> 35:20.443
I wanted all that so badly, but I held back and stayed with him.

591
35:20.513 --> 35:22.613
Then he got famous and dumped me.

592
35:22.683 --> 35:25.553
If a rookie is like that, imagine a top star.

593
35:26.723 --> 35:29.753
That coffee incident from before is nothing.

594
35:29.823 --> 35:33.063
You will either get stabbed to death or die from a broken heart.

595
35:33.123 --> 35:34.763
I think it will be one of the two.

596
35:36.063 --> 35:37.663
Who said we were dating?

597
35:37.733 --> 35:39.063
No.

598
35:39.133 --> 35:44.033
- Don't get involved with him. - That is never going to happen.

599
35:44.103 --> 35:45.103
Never.

600
35:51.983 --> 35:54.983
(Rooftop Romance)

601
36:02.253 --> 36:04.663
We demand an explanation from you.

602
36:04.723 --> 36:06.523
My gosh, what is this?

603
36:12.063 --> 36:13.103
Is anyone there?

604
36:15.903 --> 36:17.303
Someone get me out of here.

605
36:22.073 --> 36:26.883
Hello. Someone please get me out of here.

606
36:26.943 --> 36:29.483
Someone get me out. Get me out.

607
36:47.703 --> 36:49.873
Pick up the phone, Tak Mu I.

608
36:49.933 --> 36:53.173
- Did you already call him? - Yes, but he is not answering.

609
36:53.243 --> 36:55.443
Yeong Su, you know who this is, right?

610
36:55.513 --> 36:57.473
I have been crazy busy since this morning.

611
36:57.543 --> 36:58.983
Do not start with me too.

612
36:59.043 --> 37:03.013
It is a woman. And it is not me. Another woman.

613
37:03.083 --> 37:05.883
- I am in front of Mu I's house. - Let me know when you find out.

614
37:05.953 --> 37:07.453
(Da Hong)

615
37:09.493 --> 37:10.493
Hey.

616
37:10.553 --> 37:13.123
Did you have a meal alone with some woman?

617
37:13.193 --> 37:14.533
What are you talking about?

618
37:14.593 --> 37:17.603
You do not know? Look at this.

619
37:18.603 --> 37:21.373
(I saw Tak Mu I at a restaurant today. My gosh.)

620
37:28.543 --> 37:29.913
This is driving me crazy.

621
37:30.913 --> 37:32.113
(He was dining with a woman. They looked great together.)

622
37:34.213 --> 37:36.153
I thought you said nobody would care.

623
37:40.883 --> 37:42.623
That mysterious lover.

624
37:42.623 --> 37:44.523
See if her personal information got leaked.

625
37:46.693 --> 37:48.093
I read all the comments, but there is nothing.

626
37:50.133 --> 37:51.633
This woman's silhouette...

627
37:52.633 --> 37:54.403
Why does it look so familiar?

628
37:57.233 --> 38:00.603
But you know, Tak Mu I...

629
38:00.673 --> 38:02.543
I can see why women like him.

630
38:02.613 --> 38:04.073
That innocent-looking face...

631
38:04.143 --> 38:05.983
with just a hint of sexiness?

632
38:07.543 --> 38:09.413
Oh right, he goes to your salon.

633
38:09.483 --> 38:12.553
Yes. It is a different team,

634
38:12.623 --> 38:14.793
but both the makeup and hair teams say...

635
38:14.853 --> 38:18.423
he is incredibly kind and nice. He never acts entitled,

636
38:18.493 --> 38:20.793
and he always brings his own drinks in a tumbler.

637
38:20.863 --> 38:22.433
Because he feels bad asking them to get it.

638
38:24.563 --> 38:26.363
Why are you looking so pleased?

639
38:27.973 --> 38:31.703
Oh, I quit the convenience store and got a new part-time job.

640
38:33.173 --> 38:34.743
I actually heard about that from Yeon Ju.

641
38:35.873 --> 38:38.883
How about getting a husband instead of a job?

642
38:40.183 --> 38:41.313
What are you talking about now?

643
38:42.853 --> 38:45.553
When I had my part-time job, I went to see that chef...

644
38:45.623 --> 38:48.323
- every payday. - Why? Is he handsome?

645
38:48.393 --> 38:49.393
Hey.

646
38:50.693 --> 38:51.693
He is gorgeous.

647
38:53.663 --> 38:55.363
Compared to Tak Mu I,

648
38:55.433 --> 38:57.293
he has a different kind of sexiness.

649
38:57.363 --> 38:58.633
He just has that vibe.

650
38:59.903 --> 39:01.203
Is he sexy?

651
39:07.573 --> 39:08.943
(Frozen)

652
39:20.023 --> 39:23.023
(Psychiatrist Yoon Jae Gyu)

653
39:24.963 --> 39:28.093
- Will you not tell me who it is? - No.

654
39:28.163 --> 39:31.303
If I tell you, it will obviously get to Da Hong.

655
39:31.363 --> 39:32.603
It is too much of a hassle.

656
39:32.663 --> 39:33.703
That is true.

657
39:35.073 --> 39:37.233
But what are you going to do about your lack of sleep?

658
39:37.303 --> 39:39.773
I keep having the same dream over and over.

659
39:39.843 --> 39:42.743
Someone is forcing me to eat something,

660
39:42.813 --> 39:45.783
or I am trapped in a tight space and cannot move.

661
39:45.843 --> 39:47.183
How do you feel in the dream?

662
39:48.953 --> 39:50.713
Well,

663
39:50.783 --> 39:51.823
scared,

664
39:52.983 --> 39:54.653
lonely,

665
39:54.723 --> 39:56.393
and suffocated.

666
39:56.453 --> 39:58.323
I know you do not want to get counseling from me.

667
39:58.393 --> 39:59.663
Should I find you a good doctor?

668
40:00.663 --> 40:02.233
No thanks.

669
40:02.293 --> 40:04.633
It is not bad enough for counseling.

670
40:04.703 --> 40:06.133
Just prescribe some sleeping pills for me.

671
40:07.403 --> 40:10.303
I tried to push through it,

672
40:10.373 --> 40:12.973
but I cannot let it affect the shoot.

673
40:13.973 --> 40:17.743
I will do it, but you need to find the root cause.

674
40:18.943 --> 40:19.943
I know.

675
40:20.943 --> 40:23.913
(Fishing Zone, Soccer, Climbing)

676
40:27.183 --> 40:28.553
Yes, Chef.

677
40:28.623 --> 40:31.863
You didn't forget your first shift tonight, right?

678
40:31.923 --> 40:35.933
Of course not. Is there anything I need to bring?

679
40:35.993 --> 40:39.463
No, just come as you are. I have your uniform ready.

680
40:39.533 --> 40:41.803
Okay, I won't be late.

681
40:41.873 --> 40:43.973
- See you later. - Okay.

682
40:51.813 --> 40:54.083
You're Mr. Tak, right?

683
40:56.383 --> 40:58.083
You are. Tak Mu I.

684
40:59.983 --> 41:02.253
- I get that a lot. - Come on.

685
41:02.323 --> 41:05.623
How could I not recognize my own son-in-law?

686
41:05.693 --> 41:09.193
My daughter is a huge fan of yours.

687
41:09.263 --> 41:11.363
My son-in-law recently...

688
41:11.433 --> 41:14.103
was in the movie "I Didn't Know Back Then," and...

689
41:14.163 --> 41:17.873
now you're doing that rooftop something?

690
41:17.943 --> 41:19.543
You're in that drama.

691
41:20.943 --> 41:23.243
- Yes. - Oh, my.

692
41:23.313 --> 41:25.113
You look much better in person.

693
41:26.713 --> 41:27.713
Thank you.

694
41:29.953 --> 41:33.523
But who are you really dating?

695
41:33.583 --> 41:34.593
Is it Ju Da Hong?

696
41:34.653 --> 41:37.223
Or the woman you were photographed with the other day?

697
41:39.263 --> 41:41.993
Every time my son-in-law gets into a dating rumor,

698
41:42.063 --> 41:44.463
my daughter goes crazy.

699
41:47.233 --> 41:49.773
We're not like that at all.

700
41:52.803 --> 41:55.113
Hey, can I get an autograph later?

701
41:56.313 --> 41:57.813
A picture would be even better.

702
42:09.323 --> 42:10.423
Excuse me, sir.

703
42:12.023 --> 42:13.063
I'm sorry, but...

704
42:55.403 --> 42:57.373
(Mu I)

705
42:57.433 --> 42:59.443
The person is unavailable. After the beep...

706
43:05.013 --> 43:07.483
I'll prescribe you a mild sleeping pill for now.

707
43:07.543 --> 43:08.583
Don't drink alcohol.

708
43:08.653 --> 43:10.353
Only take it when you really can't sleep.

709
43:10.413 --> 43:11.583
The person is unavailable.

710
43:11.653 --> 43:14.083
You will be connected to voicemail after the beep.

711
43:17.893 --> 43:20.663
What's wrong with your voice? Is something wrong?

712
43:22.163 --> 43:23.163
Yu Il.

713
43:25.303 --> 43:26.833
I don't have a mask...

714
43:29.273 --> 43:30.673
and I feel dizzy.

715
43:32.073 --> 43:33.073
By any chance,

716
43:34.403 --> 43:35.973
could you come here?

717
43:42.013 --> 43:43.653
Found you.

718
43:43.713 --> 43:45.753
- You startled me. - Are you okay?

719
43:45.823 --> 43:48.093
- Yes. - You should have called 911.

720
43:48.153 --> 43:51.663
Well, this happened before, and...

721
43:51.723 --> 43:54.863
articles speculated that I was on drugs,

722
43:54.933 --> 43:57.133
so I had to go to the police station...

723
43:57.193 --> 43:59.303
and get drug tested.

724
43:59.363 --> 44:02.473
Anyway, it caused a lot of trouble.

725
44:04.333 --> 44:05.603
Even so.

726
44:06.843 --> 44:10.573
I want to go home...

727
44:10.643 --> 44:12.113
without drawing attention.

728
44:17.413 --> 44:18.453
Hold on.

729
44:21.553 --> 44:23.193
Let's go like this.

730
44:23.253 --> 44:25.863
I think this will stand out even more.

731
44:25.923 --> 44:30.293
But you're not Tak Mu I, you're a chicken head, so it's fine.

732
44:30.363 --> 44:31.363
Let's hurry.

733
44:32.863 --> 44:33.863
Okay.

734
44:35.103 --> 44:36.173
- Welcome. - Careful.

735
44:42.473 --> 44:44.213
- Are you okay? - Yes.

736
44:48.583 --> 44:50.253
Are you heading to an event or something?

737
44:50.313 --> 44:51.623
Yes.

738
44:53.653 --> 44:54.653
Here.

739
44:59.623 --> 45:00.693
Just a moment.

740
45:02.133 --> 45:04.163
There, just hang in there a little longer.

741
45:16.643 --> 45:18.443
Thank you.

742
45:18.513 --> 45:20.783
Are you sure you do not need to go to the hospital?

743
45:20.843 --> 45:22.483
Yes.

744
45:22.553 --> 45:24.213
I think it is because I have not been sleeping well.

745
45:26.883 --> 45:28.653
Okay, get some sleep.

746
45:36.093 --> 45:38.503
I came out to bring Mu I some side dishes.

747
45:38.563 --> 45:41.003
I am almost there. He said he had the day off today.

748
45:41.063 --> 45:43.573
When you get there, tell him to give Da Hong a chance.

749
45:44.873 --> 45:48.173
Okay. I will talk to him, Grandma.

750
45:55.583 --> 45:58.423
Yes. He was wearing a weird mask...

751
45:58.483 --> 46:01.083
and went inside with some woman 30 minutes ago.

752
46:02.723 --> 46:03.723
Yes.

753
46:06.923 --> 46:08.733
(Rooftop Romance)

754
46:08.793 --> 46:10.833
(Rooftop Romance Episode One)

755
46:20.173 --> 46:21.443
(Breathe one beat late. Control your emotions.)

756
46:27.513 --> 46:29.613
He works really hard.

757
46:33.883 --> 46:35.423
What?

758
46:35.493 --> 46:36.493
Wait...

759
46:38.523 --> 46:41.163
What brings you here, Gong Yu Il?

760
46:42.563 --> 46:43.833
Well, I was on my way,

761
46:43.893 --> 46:46.133
and he called asking if I could come over.

762
46:47.663 --> 46:50.033
He called you too, Yu Il.

763
46:50.103 --> 46:51.803
Is Mu I okay?

764
46:51.873 --> 46:54.273
He fell asleep a little while ago.

765
46:54.343 --> 46:56.143
Have a seat.

766
47:01.613 --> 47:02.613
Are you okay?

767
47:04.813 --> 47:07.453
I was worried because I had a lot of missed calls from you.

768
47:07.523 --> 47:10.553
I was dizzy and felt like throwing up,

769
47:10.623 --> 47:12.963
but Gong Yu Il saved me.

770
47:13.023 --> 47:14.063
I should thank her.

771
47:14.123 --> 47:15.433
Mu I, let's go to the hospital first, okay?

772
47:15.493 --> 47:18.203
I feel a bit better after getting some sleep.

773
47:18.263 --> 47:19.733
Yeong Su,

774
47:19.803 --> 47:22.003
could you take Gong Yu Il home?

775
47:22.073 --> 47:24.573
Sure. Get some more sleep, okay?

776
47:24.633 --> 47:25.973
Okay, thanks.

777
47:34.483 --> 47:36.153
What? Where did she go?

778
47:39.853 --> 47:40.853
What is this?

779
47:43.853 --> 47:46.193
I have to go to my part-time job, so I am leaving first.

780
48:07.343 --> 48:11.413
- Order caviar and meringue. - Yes, Chef.

781
48:17.793 --> 48:19.393
It looks good on you.

782
48:19.463 --> 48:21.463
Thank you.

783
48:21.523 --> 48:25.233
Hello, I am Gong Yu Il. I look forward to working with you.

784
48:25.303 --> 48:27.163
- Let's give her a hand. - You look great.

785
48:31.103 --> 48:32.103
Welcome to the team.

786
48:54.623 --> 48:55.633
Hey.

787
48:56.363 --> 48:57.763
What are you thinking so hard about?

788
49:00.663 --> 49:03.903
Min Jeong, do you happen to know...

789
49:03.973 --> 49:05.673
about the author of Byeol I and Moon Bear?

790
49:08.873 --> 49:09.973
Well,

791
49:10.043 --> 49:11.683
I think I heard somewhere a long time ago...

792
49:11.743 --> 49:14.383
that a high school girl wrote it.

793
49:15.583 --> 49:16.583
Really?

794
49:20.453 --> 49:23.723
By the way, when is the housekeeper coming back?

795
49:23.793 --> 49:25.363
If she is helping her daughter after childbirth,

796
49:25.423 --> 49:26.563
two weeks should be enough.

797
49:27.893 --> 49:28.933
It has been.

798
49:30.133 --> 49:31.233
I miss her cooking.

799
49:32.503 --> 49:34.233
You are really something.

800
49:34.303 --> 49:35.833
You should just hire someone else.

801
49:37.033 --> 49:38.273
I do not like changing people.

802
49:39.903 --> 49:41.913
Mrs. Kim does do a neat job.

803
49:45.443 --> 49:47.983
But why aren't you dating anyone?

804
49:51.083 --> 49:52.783
Let's not ask each other...

805
49:52.853 --> 49:55.053
about our dating lives, Mu I.

806
49:56.493 --> 49:57.493
Eat up.

807
50:07.703 --> 50:08.773
I am exhausted.

808
50:10.773 --> 50:11.803
My poor legs.

809
50:12.803 --> 50:15.613
There is always a reason why the hourly wage is so high.

810
50:22.653 --> 50:24.883
Are you sure you do not need to go to the hospital?

811
50:24.953 --> 50:26.623
Yes.

812
50:26.683 --> 50:28.423
I think it is because I have not been sleeping well.

813
50:33.063 --> 50:36.133
How long do you have to go without sleep to get like that?

814
50:46.543 --> 50:49.113
(Writer Kkongkkong's Practice Notebook)

815
50:49.173 --> 50:50.773
(I do not think I will be able to post for a while.)

816
50:54.743 --> 50:55.983
Could it be...

817
51:02.993 --> 51:04.923
If you want to be seen as a woman by a close guy friend,

818
51:04.993 --> 51:06.763
what should you do?

819
51:06.823 --> 51:09.633
- Are you talking about Mu I? - Why ask when you already know?

820
51:11.833 --> 51:13.403
But knowing his style,

821
51:13.463 --> 51:15.833
going from close friends to suddenly seeing you as a woman...

822
51:15.903 --> 51:18.033
doesn't seem very likely.

823
51:18.103 --> 51:19.173
No, it is possible.

824
51:20.473 --> 51:23.643
Mu I used to date a girl he was close friends with.

825
51:23.713 --> 51:27.113
- Really? - Yes. She and I were close.

826
51:27.183 --> 51:29.583
I worried they would leave me out if they knew I had found out,

827
51:29.653 --> 51:30.653
so I pretended not to know.

828
51:32.023 --> 51:34.623
You held back a lot for someone with your personality.

829
51:34.683 --> 51:36.493
Just wait until I turn 20.

830
51:36.553 --> 51:39.263
The day I am no longer a minor, I am going to snatch him away.

831
51:39.323 --> 51:41.063
Well, that was the plan.

832
51:41.123 --> 51:42.533
And then?

833
51:42.593 --> 51:43.593
They broke up.

834
51:46.103 --> 51:47.103
I see.

835
51:49.933 --> 51:53.943
But are you really serious about Mu I?

836
51:54.003 --> 51:55.073
You are not just joking around?

837
51:56.243 --> 51:57.773
No, I am not.

838
51:58.813 --> 52:01.613
I have never even thought about anyone else.

839
52:01.683 --> 52:02.783
Not even for a second.

840
52:09.323 --> 52:11.323
(Harin City Entrance)

841
52:21.063 --> 52:22.503
(We sincerely thank you for taking the time to interview.)

842
52:22.573 --> 52:24.373
(Grasshopper Unfortunately, we regret to say...)

843
52:24.433 --> 52:25.603
(that you were not selected.)

844
52:29.813 --> 52:31.573
Why did the results come out so fast...

845
52:32.583 --> 52:34.743
(Harin City Entrance)

846
52:37.583 --> 52:39.223
Should I try writing again?

847
52:44.353 --> 52:46.363
(Actor's Dressing Room)

848
52:48.593 --> 52:52.633
Our Kkong must be feeling terrible right now.

849
52:52.703 --> 52:53.933
Producer Yeon Ju.

850
52:53.933 --> 52:57.273
- Yes, hello. - I became close friends with Yu Il.

851
52:58.573 --> 52:59.673
Is that so?

852
52:59.743 --> 53:03.373
Our Yu Il is getting very close with celebrities these days.

853
53:03.443 --> 53:06.513
- I really like her so much. - Yes.

854
53:06.583 --> 53:08.143
What was Yu Il like as a student?

855
53:08.213 --> 53:12.853
Well, she was quiet but also famous.

856
53:12.923 --> 53:17.353
- She was famous? - Yes, she was a really good writer.

857
53:17.423 --> 53:19.293
She swept up every single award,

858
53:19.363 --> 53:21.393
and when she wrote a story, the class would pass it around.

859
53:22.463 --> 53:24.033
That is so cool.

860
53:25.833 --> 53:28.673
Do not mention it to her, though. She hates it.

861
53:29.873 --> 53:31.873
- Have a good day. - You too.

862
53:38.543 --> 53:41.283
Where did you get that? It is not even published yet.

863
53:41.343 --> 53:42.813
Well, do I have to tell you that?

864
53:42.883 --> 53:44.113
The book was not officially published.

865
53:44.183 --> 53:46.653
They only printed a few copies as proofreading drafts.

866
53:46.723 --> 53:49.723
I picked it up because it was tossed in the recycling area.

867
53:51.193 --> 53:52.623
Kkong.

868
53:52.963 --> 53:55.263
When an author does not release something to the world,

869
53:55.333 --> 53:58.293
there must be a reason. They might be embarrassed.

870
54:19.083 --> 54:22.393
What do I do? I really have no money.

871
54:26.863 --> 54:27.863
You are finally here?

872
54:31.033 --> 54:32.033
I am sorry.

873
54:33.503 --> 54:34.633
I said I am sorry.

874
54:36.173 --> 54:38.433
I made a terrible mistake.

875
54:38.503 --> 54:41.043
So let's get back together.

876
54:41.103 --> 54:43.173
You sent me a single text message to break up,

877
54:43.243 --> 54:44.713
and now what are you doing?

878
54:44.773 --> 54:46.413
I realized there is no one like you.

879
54:46.483 --> 54:47.843
The women at work only care about my background.

880
54:49.153 --> 54:51.613
Didn't you say you liked someone else?

881
54:51.683 --> 54:55.353
Her? Hey, don't even bring her up.

882
54:55.423 --> 54:57.993
We were flirting at work, and we met outside,

883
54:58.053 --> 54:59.323
but suddenly she said she has no intention...

884
54:59.393 --> 55:01.393
of dating someone from work.

885
55:01.463 --> 55:03.833
She said she only liked me because I have pretty fingers.

886
55:03.893 --> 55:05.463
So what?

887
55:05.533 --> 55:07.003
Go and beg her.

888
55:07.063 --> 55:09.033
Do you think I didn't try that?

889
55:09.103 --> 55:11.073
I went to her house, got on my knees, and did everything I could.

890
55:11.133 --> 55:13.003
I did it all.

891
55:13.073 --> 55:14.943
But she was already dating a senior colleague.

892
55:15.003 --> 55:16.373
Some son of a congressman.

893
55:17.573 --> 55:19.943
Hey, it turns out she is a total snob.

894
55:20.013 --> 55:22.213
I don't want to hear about that.

895
55:22.283 --> 55:24.683
Deal with your heartbreak on your own.

896
55:26.853 --> 55:28.553
I'm saying we should get back together.

897
55:28.623 --> 55:30.153
Hey, let's be completely honest,

898
55:30.223 --> 55:32.093
my background is much better than yours.

899
55:33.363 --> 55:34.893
I will even help you get a job.

900
55:36.833 --> 55:37.833
What?

901
55:39.403 --> 55:41.203
Get lost.

902
55:41.263 --> 55:42.803
Darn it.

903
55:42.873 --> 55:44.173
She told you to get lost.

904
55:47.503 --> 55:48.573
Do you want me to say it one more time?

905
55:48.643 --> 55:49.943
She said get lost, you jerk.

906
55:51.513 --> 55:54.343
Listening to you is pissing me off. Go screw yourself, you jerk.

907
55:55.813 --> 55:58.453
Go. Go.

908
56:06.093 --> 56:08.123
- Cheers. - Cheers.

909
56:12.033 --> 56:13.103
This is nice.

910
56:16.303 --> 56:19.043
You have learned a lot of my secrets.

911
56:20.303 --> 56:21.903
I didn't mean to eavesdrop.

912
56:23.073 --> 56:27.143
It's okay. I really wanted a drink today,

913
